# ✅ 1. Build the full development container (includes dependencies and virtualenv)
```bash
make build-model
```

# 🔐 2. Start an interactive shell inside the container (so you can authenticate and download gated models)
```bash
make shell
```

# 🧠 3. Run the setup script with your Hugging Face token
```bash
poetry run bash .script/startup.sh
```
⏳ This will securely download the Mixtral model and embeddings only if HF_TOKEN is provided.

# 📦 4. (Optional) After validation, create your slim production image
```bash
make build-runtime
make run
```